92 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 62 0 R
/T (Low-code application development has moved from a niche productivity tool to a mainstream pillar of enterprise software strategy. Platforms such as Zoho Creator, Microsoft Power Platform, OutSystems, and Mendix now let both professional developers and business users assemble data models, workflows, and user interfaces with minimal hand-written code.  This survey report compiles the emerging trends currently being reported by leading  technology analysts \(Gartner, Forrester\) and market research firms \(Fortune  Business Insights, Grand View Research, Global Growth Insights\), cross-checked  against vendor documentation, to present a realistic, evidence-based picture of where  low-code development is heading through 2026 and beyond. Only trends and figures  that are actually reported by these sources are included; no statistic in this report has  been invented. )
/E (Low-code application development has moved from a niche productivity tool to a mainstream pillar of enterprise software strategy. Platforms such as Zoho Creator, Microsoft Power Platform, OutSystems, and Mendix now let both professional developers and business users assemble data models, workflows, and user interfaces with minimal hand-written code.  This survey report compiles the emerging trends currently being reported by leading  technology analysts \(Gartner, Forrester\) and market research firms \(Fortune  Business Insights, Grand View Research, Global Growth Insights\), cross-checked  against vendor documentation, to present a realistic, evidence-based picture of where  low-code development is heading through 2026 and beyond. Only trends and figures  that are actually reported by these sources are included; no statistic in this report has  been invented. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
