219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 70 0 R
/T (This survey confirms six consistent, evidence-backed trends: low-code is becoming default enterprise infrastructure rather than a niche tool; generative AI is being embedded directly into the build process; the builder base is widening toward business users through fusion-team models; governance and security are becoming prerequisites rather than afterthoughts; enterprises are standardizing on multiple low-code platforms as long-term infrastructure; and individual platforms such as Zoho Creator are actively shipping these same capabilities in production today.  Taken together, the survey indicates that low-code development in 2026  is defined less by "faster app building" alone and more by how well a  platform balances speed, AI assistance, and governance at enterprise  scale. )
/E (This survey confirms six consistent, evidence-backed trends: low-code is becoming default enterprise infrastructure rather than a niche tool; generative AI is being embedded directly into the build process; the builder base is widening toward business users through fusion-team models; governance and security are becoming prerequisites rather than afterthoughts; enterprises are standardizing on multiple low-code platforms as long-term infrastructure; and individual platforms such as Zoho Creator are actively shipping these same capabilities in production today.  Taken together, the survey indicates that low-code development in 2026  is defined less by "faster app building" alone and more by how well a  platform balances speed, AI assistance, and governance at enterprise  scale. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
